<title>SPAIN: Dragados says 9-mth profit down 2.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Dragados says 9-mth profit down 2.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish construction group Dragados for the nine months to September 30 in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net profit				 5.05    down 2.2 pct</p>
<p> Turnover				 298.88    up   2.1 pct</p>
<p> Orders pending			 630.00    up   7.0 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Dragados said the increase in sales was based on significant growth in the Dragados Industrial companies and international business, whose sales were 20 and 18 percent higher respectively.</p>
<p>Growth in orders pending execution also stemmed from growth in these two divisions, Dragados said.</p>
<p>The company provided no further detail.</p>
</text>
